{"id":"645ee8d3e395cd8f","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-consistency-pi1.md","title":"fact-consistency-pi1 — Consistency Statement is Pi 1","display":"fact-consistency-pi1 — Consistency Statement is Pi_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-consistency-pi1","aliases":["92-fact-consistency-pi1"],"display":"fact-consistency-pi1 — Consistency Statement is Pi_1","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-consistency-pi1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-consistency-pi1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-consistency-pi1 — Consistency Statement is Pi_1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (bounded internal proof formula and induced provability constructor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (fixed contradiction sentence)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Con}_G=\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Con}_G=\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>：一致性句是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>句子</li>\n<li>等价展开为“没有自然数编码一个以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>为结论的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明”</li>\n<li>&quot;对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>不是矛盾的证明&quot;</li>\n<li>规范Gödel句也可选在该层级，但任意只在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中与它可证等价的句子未必具有同一字面复杂度</li>\n<li>层级归类本身不推出其在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证或不可证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ (consistency sentence, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resol